==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|organic chemistry}} Any [[polymer]] of (same or different) [[amino acid]]s joined via [[peptide bond]]s.
# {{context|biochemistry}} Any such polymer that is not [[folded]] into a [[secondary structure]] of a [[protein]].
# {{protein}} A small [[protein]] containing up to 100 [[amino acid]]s; see also [[oligopeptide]].

